{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t\tTechnology\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology\/machine_learning' data-target='computer\/technology\/machine_learning' data-title='Machine Learning'>\r\n\t\t\tMachine Learning\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"CNNs learn features from raw pixels: input feature map (width, height, RGB depth) and a stack of convolution, ReLU, pooling.","label":"CNN","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/machine_learning\/links","label":"Links","url":"\/computer\/technology\/machine_learning\/links"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCNNs learn features from raw pixels: input feature map (width, height, RGB depth) and a stack of convolution, ReLU, pooling.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIntro to CNN.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/machine-learning\/practica\/image-classification\/convolutional-neural-networks\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConvoluted Neural Network. Breakthrough: progressively extract higher- and higher-level representations of the image content.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInstead of preprocessing the data to derive features like textures and shapes, a CNN takes just the image's raw pixel data as input and \"learns\" how to extract these features, and ultimately infer what object they constitute.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Input feature map<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMatrix:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Width: image width.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Height: image height.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Depth: R, G, B.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h2>Modules<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tA CNN comprises a stack of modules. Each module performs 3 tasks:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Convolution.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>ReLU.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Pooling.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>Convoluted map<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConvolution extracts tiles of the input feature map and applies filters. Two factors:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Size of tile \u2014 typically 3x3 or 5x5.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Depth: number of filters.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<p>\n\t\tApplication of filter:\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/machine_learning\/cnn\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/machine_learning\/cnn\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/machine_learning\/links' data-target='computer\/technology\/machine_learning\/links' data-title='Links' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Links<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/technology\/machine_learning' data-target='computer\/technology\/machine_learning' data-title='Machine Learning'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/technology\/machine_learning.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Machine Learning<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}